      "> B8.3.2.2.2",
      "",
      "### Section A — Objective",
      "",
      "1.The formula for the area of a circle is… A. 2πr B. πr² C. πd D. ½πr² **[K]** 2.The side opposite the right angle in a right-angled triangle is called the… A. adjacent B. opposite C. hypotenuse D. altitude **[K]**",
      "",
