      "> **Practice 12.4**",
      ">",
      "> 1. Define mean, median, mode and range.",
      ">",
      "> 2. Kojo's taxi made 8, 6, 10, 10, 9, 10 and 3 trips on the seven days of a week. Find the mean, median, mode and range.",
      ">",
